title: 'Hooks: Command executor uses blocking I/O that can deadlock'
updated_at: "2026-08-02T05:19:36Z"
---
Reviewer finding #4: hooks_exec.ml:88,101 use blocking Unix.write/Unix.read. Sequential stdout-then-stderr reads at :128 can deadlock. Timeout via Lwt.pick cannot fire while blocking. Fix: use Lwt_io or non-blocking reads, read both streams concurrently.